- **Mutations:** each of the 13 fails the test.
- **Codacy-style checks:** flawfinder and lizard report nothing on the new files (all complexity ≤ 10), and no identifier is named `time`. These cover what Codacy flagged on #393.
- **xmat** (`run --dirty -t mac-arm64 --with headless`): all steps pass.

